# Input

```scss
@PROPERTY   --#{ $name }{
  syntax:"<color>";
  inherits:false;
  initial-value:red;
}

@property --theme-#{$name} {syntax: "<length>"; inherits: true; initial-value: 0px;}

@property --#{$prefix}-#{$name}-Color {}

```


# Formatted

```scss
@property --#{$name} {
	syntax: "<color>";
	inherits: false;
	initial-value: red;
}

@property --theme-#{$name} {
	syntax: "<length>";
	inherits: true;
	initial-value: 0px;
}

@property --#{$prefix}-#{$name}-Color {
}

```
